# Converted game data: made from your own Valve/GMod installs by tools/bspconv. It belongs to Valve and
# Facepunch, so it never goes in the repo. Rebuild it with the converter (see README.md).
psp/data/*
!psp/data/lua/
psp/data_backup/
psp/release/
audio_check/
screenshots/

# Build outputs
*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.PBP
psp/PARAM.SFO
__pycache__/
*.pyc
